# AI & scoring conventions

- All LLM traffic through `ai-gateway`. Direct SDK imports elsewhere are a blocking defect.
- Structured, schema-validated JSON only — never regex a tier from prose.
- Prompts are versioned immutably (`*.vN.ts`); in-place edits forbidden. Ship golden-set results with prompt PRs.
- Evaluation emits **raw scores**; tier assignment uses Vedika's published `cut_scores` + `scoring-engine`.
- Auto-pause automated scoring when Cohen's κ < 0.65.
- `scoring-engine` stays pure Effect.ts: no I/O, no `Date.now()`, no randomness.
- Stub the gateway in CI — never live LLM calls in tests.
